Kompas studio photo v1. Editorial visual review approved.
Original SHA-256: 5792cfb95f2815a4fdd2106a6de58b0190003dca5e0bb9426dd0baa98f6feb14
Four progressive attempts at a small joined wood practice piece arranged quietly by order, tactile wear visible and a single improved finished piece. Make one original ultra-realistic live editorial studio photograph for the independent magazine Kompas. Wide landscape about 1.9:1, central subject inside the middle 75% for a consistent crop; clear plausible optics and readable shadow detail. Real controlled directional daylight, neutral-warm color, tactile ordinary materials, one purposeful subject and an interesting but restrained sense of depth. Photographic, no layout or decorative graphics. No people, faces, hands, silhouettes, visible lettering, numbers, logos, neon, fake interface or watermarks.
